Flowscape Analysis Platform
Vision

Create a generic, extensible engineering analysis platform that transforms simulation state into structured transportation engineering knowledge.

The Analysis Platform is not part of the simulation engine. It does not influence vehicle behavior, routing, demand generation, or roadway geometry. Instead, it observes the simulation, evaluates it using engineering principles, and produces reusable analysis results.

These analysis results become the foundation for every user-facing feature in Flowscape, including the Inspector, reports, charts, scenario comparison, educational lessons, assessments, and optional AI-assisted explanations.

The goal is to build the analysis once and allow many different applications to consume it.

