Phase 5 — Recommendation Engine
Goal

Generate possible engineering improvements.

Recommendations are independent from findings.

A finding may produce zero, one, or many recommendations.

Example

Finding

Stopping Sight Distance Deficiency

↓

Recommendations

Increase curve radius
Reduce design speed
Remove sight obstruction

Each recommendation contains:

Expected benefit
Tradeoffs
Supporting evidence
Confidence (if applicable)
