Initial Implementation Roadmap
Milestone 1 — Core Framework
Implement immutable simulation snapshots.
Build the pipeline engine and dependency resolver.
Add plugin registration for observations, metrics, findings, and recommendations.
Milestone 2 — Traffic Operations
Implement observations for traffic state and road geometry.
Add metrics for capacity, delay, queue length, V/C ratio, and Level of Service.
Generate findings and recommendations for congestion and operational issues.
Milestone 3 — Geometric Design
Add observations for roadway geometry and visibility.
Implement Stopping Sight Distance as the first geometric metric.
Extend findings and recommendations for roadway design deficiencies.
Milestone 4 — User-Facing Applications
Integrate analysis into the Inspector.
Add charts, reports, and scenario comparison.
Expose overlays for observations, metrics, and findings.
Support automated lesson and assessment generation.
